The build links SDL2 and OpenGL/GLVND when GRACE_ENABLE_OPENGL is enabled,
and the physics and scripting SDKs when their GRACE_ENABLE_PHYSX /
GRACE_ENABLE_BULLET / GRACE_ENABLE_BOX2D / GRACE_ENABLE_ANGELSCRIPT options
are enabled. The middleware SDKs are pinned as git submodules of this
repository and are built by the project's own configuration when the
corresponding option is enabled; no part of any of them is redistributed in
binary form.

