NVIDIA PhysX SDK 3.4
  https://github.com/NVIDIAGameWorks/PhysX-3.4
  Copyright (c) 2018 NVIDIA Corporation. All rights reserved.
  Licence: 3-Clause BSD
  Status: linked when GRACE_ENABLE_PHYSX is enabled, as the extra-physics
  backend (CPU cloth and soft body).

  Not vendored. The SDK is pinned as a git submodule and built by this
  project's configuration through its own Makefiles; no part of it is
  redistributed in binary form from this repository. The checkout is patched
  in place before building (the makefiles ship with -Werror, which modern
  GCC rejects, and one header needs a const-correctness fix). A binary
  distribution that links it must reproduce the copyright notice, the list
  of conditions and the disclaimer, as clause 2 requires. The APEX SDK
  shipped in the same depot is deprecated and is not used.

